dt-bindings: watchdog: sun4i-a10-wdt: add the H713

The H713's watchdog at 0x02051000 has the A523's register file: CTRL at
+0x0c (reload 0x14af), CFG at +0x10, MODE at +0x14, every CFG/MODE write
keyed with 0x16aa in the upper half. U-Boot binds it with the same two
strings (dts/upstream sun50i-h713-hy200-qz713df-a1.dts), and a hand-set
MODE 0x16aa00b1 resets the HY310 after 16.4 s (07.10.2026, doku/164).
The H713 string names the SoC, the A523 one carries the layout; the
existing condition on allwinner,sun55i-a523-wdt then asks for both clocks
and their names (hosc, losc).

